      "text": "Essa é uma forma que eu recomendo para você estudar.\n\nDATA PLANE\nRECEIVER\n   ↓\nPROCESSOR\n   ↓\nCONNECTOR\n   ↓\nPROCESSOR\n   ↓\nEXPORTER\n\nÉ o fluxo da telemetria.\n\nCONTROL / SERVICE PLANE\nExtensions\n   │\n   ├── Health\n   ├── Auth\n   ├── Discovery\n   ├── Storage\n   ├── Diagnostics\n   └── Runtime\nCONFIGURATION PLANE\nconfig.yaml\n      │\n      ▼\nComponents\n      │\n      ▼\nservice:\n  extensions\n  pipelines\n  telemetry",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "SVwvmlpxSRslZIeXAlp8J",
      "originalText": "Essa é uma forma que eu recomendo para você estudar.\n\nDATA PLANE\nRECEIVER\n   ↓\nPROCESSOR\n   ↓\nCONNECTOR\n   ↓\nPROCESSOR\n   ↓\nEXPORTER\n\nÉ o fluxo da telemetria.\n\nCONTROL / SERVICE PLANE\nExtensions\n   │\n   ├── Health\n   ├── Auth\n   ├── Discovery\n   ├── Storage\n   ├── Diagnostics\n   └── Runtime\nCONFIGURATION PLANE\nconfig.yaml\n      │\n      ▼\nComponents\n      │\n      ▼\nservice:\n  extensions\n  pipelines\n  telemetry",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
