      "text": "15 · 🔵 EXPORTERS (a saída)\n\nOTLP / OTLP-HTTP → stable nos 3 sinais\nprometheusremotewrite · loki · kafka\njaeger · datadog · aws · azure · gcp\ndebug (troubleshooting local)\n\n💡 \"Exporter tem retry + sending_queue:\nconfigure ou perde dado em outage.\"",
