      "text": "20 · 🏛️ AGENT vs GATEWAY\n\nAGENT: junto da app/host (DaemonSet)\nApp → Agent → Gateway\nGATEWAY: central (Deployment/escalável)\nAgents → Gateway → Backends\n\n💡 \"tail_sampling e cardinalidade só\nfuncionam bem no GATEWAY.\"",
