    {
      "id": "trilha-box-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5523.245627107278,
      "y": -3385.4797701320713,
      "width": 1899.14794921875,
      "height": 147,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 5003,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 1692601869,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updatedAt": 1756600000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 FUNDAMENTOS (OTLP · Traces · Metrics · Logs · Resources · Attributes · Semantic Conventions)  →  2 COLLECTOR (Receiver · Pipeline · Processor · Exporter)  →  3 PROCESSAMENTO (attributes · resource · k8sattributes · resourcedetection · transform/OTTL · filter · redaction ·\nbatch · memory_limiter)  →  4 SAMPLING (probabilistic · tail_sampling · groupbytrace)  →  5 CONNECTORS (spanmetrics · servicegraph · routing · count · sum · failover)\n\n6 KUBERNETES (kubeletstats · k8scluster · k8sobjects · k8sevents · filelog · k8sattributes)  →  7 RESILIÊNCIA (sending_queue · retry_on_failure · file_storage · memory_limiter · failover)  →  8 SEGURANÇA (TLS · mTLS · Auth · Authorization · Redaction · Secrets)  →  9\nPERFORMANCE (CPU · Memory · Throughput · Batch · Queue · Concurrency · Cardinality · Backpressure)  →  10 ARQUITETURA (Agent → Gateway → Routing → Processing → Backend)\n\n🎤 FECHAMENTO: \"O Collector não é um proxy de OTLP. É onde você faz engenharia de observabilidade: enriquece, filtra, protege PII, controla custo e deriva sinais — antes do dado tocar o backend.\"",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "trilha-box",
      "originalText": "1 FUNDAMENTOS (OTLP · Traces · Metrics · Logs · Resources · Attributes · Semantic Conventions)  →  2 COLLECTOR (Receiver · Pipeline · Processor · Exporter)  →  3 PROCESSAMENTO (attributes · resource · k8sattributes · resourcedetection · transform/OTTL · filter · redaction · batch · memory_limiter)  →  4 SAMPLING (probabilistic · tail_sampling · groupbytrace)  →  5 CONNECTORS (spanmetrics · servicegraph · routing · count · sum · failover)\n\n6 KUBERNETES (kubeletstats · k8scluster · k8sobjects · k8sevents · filelog · k8sattributes)  →  7 RESILIÊNCIA (sending_queue · retry_on_failure · file_storage · memory_limiter · failover)  →  8 SEGURANÇA (TLS · mTLS · Auth · Authorization · Redaction · Secrets)  →  9 PERFORMANCE (CPU · Memory · Throughput · Batch · Queue · Concurrency · Cardinality · Backpressure)  →  10 ARQUITETURA (Agent → Gateway → Routing → Processing → Backend)\n\n🎤 FECHAMENTO: \"O Collector não é um proxy de OTLP. É onde você faz engenharia de observabilidade: enriquece, filtra, protege PII, controla custo e deriva sinais — antes do dado tocar o backend.\"",
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0M",
      "updated": 1788639081920,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HGjVzTFndJsr4Fe6_gyq5",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 7866.791896589681,
      "y": -4968.46916572754,
      "width": 1078.888888888889,
      "height": 2092.222222222223,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
