      "text": " GROUP BY +\nMÉTRICAS",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "GqQvzWiiZqAtWx5-iAsGw",
      "originalText": " GROUP BY + MÉTRICAS",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "MoZTQTuBZ513k3LtW7ohQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3786.971677963255,
      "y": 47.653798761930375,
      "width": 339.84375,
      "height": 1176,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6a",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 310091363,
      "version": 366,
      "versionNonce": 1715056643,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788549967012,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "17. Group by Attributes\n\nAgrupa telemetria por\natributos.\n\nPor exemplo:\n\ntenant\nservice\nregion\nenvironment\ncustomer\n18. METRICS PROCESSING\n\nExiste uma família específica\npara métricas.\n\nMetrics\n   │\n   ├── metrics transform\n   ├── metric start time\n   ├── cumulative → delta\n   ├── delta → cumulative\n   ├── delta → rate\n   ├── metrics generation\n   └── cardinality control\n\nIsso permite construir\npipelines de métricas muito\nsofisticados.\n\n\n16. Group by Trace\n\nPermite agrupar dados por\ntrace.\n\nSpan A ─┐\nSpan B ─┼──► Group by Trace\nSpan C ─┘\n             │\n             ▼\n          Trace group\n\nIsso é particularmente\nrelevante para arquiteturas\navançadas de sampling e\nprocessamento.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2VXeS9n90kjO5QUArULDE",
      "originalText": "17. Group by Attributes\n\nAgrupa telemetria por atributos.\n\nPor exemplo:\n\ntenant\nservice\nregion\nenvironment\ncustomer\n18. METRICS PROCESSING\n\nExiste uma família específica para métricas.\n\nMetrics\n   │\n   ├── metrics transform\n   ├── metric start time\n   ├── cumulative → delta\n   ├── delta → cumulative\n   ├── delta → rate\n   ├── metrics generation\n   └── cardinality control\n\nIsso permite construir pipelines de métricas muito sofisticados.\n\n\n16. Group by Trace\n\nPermite agrupar dados por trace.\n\nSpan A ─┐\nSpan B ─┼──► Group by Trace\nSpan C ─┘\n             │\n             ▼\n          Trace group\n\nIsso é particularmente relevante para arquiteturas avançadas de sampling e processamento.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "SWt5th2VSDhdFxtv2zDvF",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 5033.004664074366,
      "y": 3724.4593543174847,
      "width": 578.3333333333339,
      "height": 1666,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
