      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "21. O poder dos Connectors\n\nImagine:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\nspanmetrics connector\n  │\n  └──────────────► METRICS\n                       │\n                       ▼\n                    Prometheus\n\nOu:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\nservicegraph\n  │\n  ▼\nMETRICS\n\nOu:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\ncount\n  │\n  ▼\nMETRICS\n\nOu:\n\nPipeline A\n   │\n   ▼\nrouting connector\n   │\n   ├────────► Pipeline B\n   │\n   ├────────► Pipeline C\n   │\n   └────────► Pipeline D",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "PywrTURfIS0YLAP7O0r_7",
      "originalText": "21. O poder dos Connectors\n\nImagine:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\nspanmetrics connector\n  │\n  └──────────────► METRICS\n                       │\n                       ▼\n                    Prometheus\n\nOu:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\nservicegraph\n  │\n  ▼\nMETRICS\n\nOu:\n\nTRACES\n  │\n  ▼\ncount\n  │\n  ▼\nMETRICS\n\nOu:\n\nPipeline A\n   │\n   ▼\nrouting connector\n   │\n   ├────────► Pipeline B\n   │\n   ├────────► Pipeline C\n   │\n   └────────► Pipeline D",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
