      "text": "22. Connectors atuais importantes\n\nA documentação atual lista:\n\ncount\ndatadog\nexceptions\nfailover\nforward\ngrafana_cloud\nmetrics_as_logs\notlp_json\nround_robin\nrouting\nservicegraph\nsignaltometrics\nslow_sql\nspanmetrics\nsum\n\nEu dividiria assim:\n\n🔄 Routing\nrouting connector\n\nDecide para qual pipeline enviar.\n\n📊 Generation\nspanmetrics\nservicegraph\ncount\nsum\nsignaltometrics\n\nTransformam/derivam sinais.\n\n🛡️ Resiliência\nfailover\n\nPermite estratégias de fallback.\n\n🔀 Distribuição\nround_robin\nforward",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "66cKg7teqC48bOjeX4mrp",
      "originalText": "22. Connectors atuais importantes\n\nA documentação atual lista:\n\ncount\ndatadog\nexceptions\nfailover\nforward\ngrafana_cloud\nmetrics_as_logs\notlp_json\nround_robin\nrouting\nservicegraph\nsignaltometrics\nslow_sql\nspanmetrics\nsum\n\nEu dividiria assim:\n\n🔄 Routing\nrouting connector\n\nDecide para qual pipeline enviar.\n\n📊 Generation\nspanmetrics\nservicegraph\ncount\nsum\nsignaltometrics\n\nTransformam/derivam sinais.\n\n🛡️ Resiliência\nfailover\n\nPermite estratégias de fallback.\n\n🔀 Distribuição\nround_robin\nforward",
      "autoResize": true,
