      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788639022387,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "O ecossistema atual possui exporters para diversos\ndestinos:\n\nPrometheus\nPrometheus Remote Write\nLoki\nKafka\nJaeger\nZipkin\nOpenSearch\nSplunk HEC\nDatadog\nAWS\nAzure\nGoogle Cloud\nSentry\nSyslog\nSumo Logic\n\ne muitos outros.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
