      "containerId": "j7YeZcIa47sHyJyBEVqy7",
      "originalText": "O ecossistema atual possui exporters para diversos destinos:\n\nPrometheus\nPrometheus Remote Write\nLoki\nKafka\nJaeger\nZipkin\nOpenSearch\nSplunk HEC\nDatadog\nAWS\nAzure\nGoogle Cloud\nSentry\nSyslog\nSumo Logic\n\ne muitos outros.",
