      "text": "18 · 🗂️ OS 3 PLANOS DO COLLECTOR\n\nDATA PLANE → receiver → ... → exporter\nCONTROL PLANE → extensions\nCONFIG PLANE → config.yaml → service:\n\n💡 \"Enxergar em 3 planos organiza\ntoda a leitura de um config.yaml.\"",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "_2cIxwIlzXxvvBu3PHB9f",
      "originalText": "18 · 🗂️ OS 3 PLANOS DO COLLECTOR\n\nDATA PLANE → receiver → ... → exporter\nCONTROL PLANE → extensions\nCONFIG PLANE → config.yaml → service:\n\n💡 \"Enxergar em 3 planos organiza\ntoda a leitura de um config.yaml.\"",
